 general contracting and construction management firm. They are known for their high-quality, and high-value work.</p> <p>We’re Vinyl Wrap Toronto, a company that specializes in decals and letterings for businesses. We designed and installed decals and letterings on Pajang Developments’ Ford F-150 pickup truck recently, which helped to increase their brand visibility while they were on the road.</p> <p>Pajang wanted us to put their logo, contact number, and website on their company pickup truck —and we were happy to help! These Avery brand vinyl decals increased their brand visibility by making them more recognizable as they drove around town.</p> <p>If you’re looking for ways to market your business or organization while driving around town (and who isn’t?), then Vinyl Wrap Toronto is here for you! We can help with everything from designing your decals and letterings to installing it onto your car or truck.</p> <p>We want to make sure that when people see our work on other vehicles around town, they know exactly who did it—because we believe in quality over quantity when it comes to our clients’ satisfaction.</p> <p>If you would like to personalize your car, truck, boat, or other personal items – as long as it fits into our garage and has a smooth surface, we would love to wrap it! For your inspiration or your next decals and letterings with Vinyl Wrap Toronto, do not forget to check out our <a href=\"/vinyl-car-wrap-our-portfolio/\">Portfolio</a>.</p> <p><a href=\"/contact/\">Get a Free Quote </a>today by filling out the form and our team will get back to you as soon as possible. You can reach us at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> or email us at <a href=\"mailto:info@vinylwraptoronto.com\">info@vinylwraptoronto.com</a>. You can also visit us at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W1B4.</a></p> <p>Don’t forget to follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a> to hear about our special deals, creative wrap projects, and vehicle branding.</p> <h4><strong>Credits:</strong></h4> <ul> <li>Decals Designed By: <strong><a href=\"https://brandingcentres.com\">Branding Centres</a></strong></li> <li>Vehicle Outline By: <strong><a href=\"http://wrapauthority.net\">Wrap Authority</a></strong></li> </ul>", "style": "text-align:start;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/lettering-decal-avery-dennison-3m-northwest/", "text": "Prev Previous Quality Decals on Northwest Protection’s Nissan Rogue"}, "next": {"href": "/custom-decals-for-chevy-silverado/", "text": "Next Custom Decals for Your Chevy Silverado – Blaklader Next"}}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "style": "text-align:center;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Share This Post", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:18px;color:var( --e-global-color-d077a13 );font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get an Estimate", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-size:21px;color:var( --e-global